## Component Library

### Location
**Base UI Components**: `components/ui/`

### Component Architecture

All UI components follow these patterns:

1. **Use `class-variance-authority` (CVA)** for variants
2. **Use `cn()` utility** for className merging
3. **Forward refs** for all interactive components
4. **Support `asChild` pattern** where appropriate (Radix UI)
5. **TypeScript types** for all props

### Available Components

#### Button (`components/ui/button.tsx`)

**Variants**:
- `default`: Brand gradient button (primary CTA)
- `destructive`: Red button for destructive actions
- `outline`: Outlined button
- `secondary`: Gray button
- `ghost`: Transparent button with hover
- `link`: Text link style
- `subtle`: Subtle background button

**Sizes**:
- `sm`: Small (h-9)
- `default`: Default (h-10)
- `lg`: Large (h-11)
- `icon`: Icon-only (h-10 w-10)

**Example**:
```tsx
<Button variant="default" size="lg">
  Create Resume
</Button>
```

#### Card (`components/ui/card.tsx`)

**Sub-components**:
- `Card`: Container
- `CardHeader`: Header section
- `CardTitle`: Title text
- `CardDescription`: Description text
- `CardContent`: Main content
- `CardFooter`: Footer section

**Example**:
```tsx
<Card>
  <CardHeader>
    <CardTitle>Resume Title</CardTitle>
    <CardDescription>Last updated 2 days ago</CardDescription>
  </CardHeader>
  <CardContent>
    {/* Content */}
  </CardContent>
</Card>
```

#### Input (`components/ui/input.tsx`)

**Features**:
- Consistent border radius (`rounded-lg`)
- Focus ring with brand color
- Proper disabled states
- Smooth transitions

**Example**:
```tsx
<Input 
  type="text" 
  placeholder="Enter resume name"
  className="w-full"
/>
```

#### Label (`components/ui/label.tsx`)

**Features**:
- Proper font weight and size
- Accessible with Radix UI
- Consistent text color

**Example**:
```tsx
<Label htmlFor="resume-name">
  Resume Name
</Label>
```

### Component Patterns

#### Using Design Tokens in Components

```tsx
// ✅ Good - Using design tokens
<button className="bg-gradient-to-r from-[#1B76FC] to-[#36C9F9] text-white rounded-lg px-4 py-2 shadow-[var(--shadow-md)] transition-all duration-200">

// ❌ Bad - Hardcoded values
<button className="bg-[#1B76FC] text-white rounded-md px-5 py-3">
```

#### Consistent Spacing

```tsx
// ✅ Good - Using spacing scale
<div className="p-6 mb-4 gap-2">

// ❌ Bad - Arbitrary values
<div className="p-[23px] mb-[17px] gap-[9px]">
```

