## Styling Approach

### Methodology
**Utility-First CSS** with Tailwind CSS

### Patterns

#### 1. Use Tailwind Utilities
```tsx
// ✅ Good
<div className="flex items-center gap-4 p-6 bg-white rounded-lg shadow-md">

// ❌ Bad - Custom CSS
<div className="custom-card">
```

#### 2. Custom Utilities for Design Tokens
```tsx
// Use Tailwind's arbitrary values for brand colors
className="bg-gradient-to-r from-[#1B76FC] to-[#36C9F9]"
```

#### 3. CSS Custom Properties for Dynamic Theming
```css
/* In globals.css */
:root {
  --brand-primary: #1B76FC;
}
```

#### 4. Component-Level Styles (Rare)
Only use component-level styles for:
- Complex animations
- CV template-specific styles
- Third-party component overrides

### Responsive Design

**Breakpoints** (Tailwind defaults):
- `sm`: 640px
- `md`: 768px
- `lg`: 1024px
- `xl`: 1280px
- `2xl`: 1536px

**Mobile-First Approach**:
```tsx
// Base styles for mobile, then add larger breakpoints
<div className="flex flex-col md:flex-row lg:gap-8">
```

### Dark Mode (Future)

CSS custom properties support dark mode:
```css
@media (prefers-color-scheme: dark) {
  :root {
    --color-background-primary: #0a0a0a;
    --color-foreground-primary: #ededed;
  }
}
```

