## Project Structure

### Current Organization
```
components/
  ui/          # Base UI components (Button, Card, Input, Label)
  forms/       # Form components (PersonalForm, ExperienceForm, etc.)
  templates/   # CV templates (ClassicTemplate, ModernTemplate, etc.)
  layout/      # Layout components (Header)
  dashboard/   # Dashboard-specific components (DashboardSidebar)
  auth/        # Authentication components
```

### Design System Files
- `lib/design-tokens.ts` - Token definitions
- `app/globals.css` - CSS custom properties
- `.cursor/rules/design_system_rules.mdc` - This document

### Component Naming Conventions
- **PascalCase** for component files: `Button.tsx`, `Card.tsx`
- **camelCase** for utilities: `cn()`, `getSpacingClass()`
- **kebab-case** for CSS classes (handled by Tailwind)

