## Migration Guide

### Updating Existing Components

1. **Replace hardcoded colors** with design tokens
2. **Use spacing scale** instead of arbitrary values
3. **Apply consistent border radius** (rounded-lg for most)
4. **Add transitions** to interactive elements
5. **Use semantic color tokens** for text colors

### Example Migration

**Before**:
```tsx
<button className="bg-[#1B76FC] text-white px-5 py-3 rounded-md">
  Create
</button>
```

**After**:
```tsx
<button className="bg-gradient-to-r from-[#1B76FC] to-[#36C9F9] text-white px-6 py-3 rounded-lg shadow-[var(--shadow-md)] transition-all duration-200 hover:shadow-lg active:scale-95">
  Create
</button>
```

